# The chat-ui image builds from the repository root (so it can copy the
# committed index, knowledge-base/index/kb_index.npz). Keep secrets, infra,
# scratch and the documents the index was built from out of the build context.
.git
# Secrets anywhere in the tree, not just the root.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/env.sh
.claude/
deploy/
docs/
.superpowers/
.index/
knowledge-base/data-sources/
.github/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
scratch.txt
tools/scrape/input/
evals/results/
**/.pytest_cache
